ly prohibited. Kindly notify ABL Circuits Ltd. immediately at 01462-894312.</div></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><br></div></div><div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><hr style=\"display:inline-block; width:98%\"><div id=\"divRplyFwdMsg\"><div style=\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>From:</b> Purchasing - Sesame Access &lt;purchasing@sesameaccess.com&gt;<br><b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, September 22, 2026 16:07<br><b>To:</b> ABL Circuits Sales &lt;sales@ablcircuits.co.uk&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Lift PCB Enquiry - Design and manufacture - SQR-45454</div><div style=\"direction:ltr\">&nbsp;</div></div><div id=\"x_divRplyFwdMsg\"><div style=\"direction:ltr; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b><br></b></div></div><div style=\"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Hello,&nbsp;</div><div style=\"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I am contacting you on behalf of Sesame Access Systems, a UK manufacturer of platform lifts for wheelchair access.</div><div style=\"direction:ltr; line-height:20px; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">We are investigating whether part of our existing DIN-rail lift control assembly could be replaced with a custom PCB. The aim is to reduce wiring, assembly time, build cost and servicing time while retaining the existing Siemens LOGO! 8 PLC and keeping the established safety functions outside the PCB.</div><div style=\"direction:ltr; line-height:20px; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Our anticipated requirement is:</div><ul style=\"direction:ltr\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); direction:ltr; line-height:20px\">Five initial prototypes</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); direction:ltr; line-height:20px\">A first production batch of approximately 25 units</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); direction:ltr; line-height:20px\">Ongoing demand of approximately 50 units per year</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); direction:ltr; line-height:20px\">PCB design, manufacture, assembly and functional testing</li></ul><div style=\"direction:ltr; line-height:20px; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I have attached our feasibility study and a representative wiring diagram. These outline the existing control system, proposed PCB scope, technical requirements, expected volumes and key design considerations.</div><div style=\"direction:ltr; line-height:20px; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">At this stage, we are looking for an experienced partner to provide an initial feasibility opinion, recommend a suitable architecture and provide indicative NRE and unit-cost estimates.</div><div style=\"direction:ltr; line-height:20px; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">If this project is within your capabilities, we would welcome an introductory Teams meeting with your design and manufacturing team.</div><div style=\"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div id=\"x_x_x_x_Signature\"><div id=\"x_x_x_x_divtagdefaultwrapper\"><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Many Thanks,</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Giles</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Purchasing Manager</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Sesame Access Systems Ltd</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Unit 1, Cumberland Works</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Wintersells Business Park</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><sp