  "body_text": "Hi Giles,\n\nThank you very much for your email.\n\nUnfortunately, we're not quite the right company for you. I highly recommend speaking with Christa Boren, christa@ripcorddesigns.com, at Ripcord Design.\n\nRipcord is an electronics design house and the perfect company to redesign this for you. We're an electronics contract manufacturer and specialise in manufacturing and assembling PCBAs, rather than design. We've worked closely with Ripcord for years, and they're brilliant.\n\nOnce the design is complete, we can step in to manufacture and assemble the PCBAs for you.\n\nThank you and good luck with the redesign!\n\nKind regards,\n\nWill Leverett\n\nDirector\n\nABL Circuits Ltd\n\nT\n\n01462 894312\n\nE\n\nwill@ablcircuits.co.uk\n\nW\n\nwww.ablcircuits.co.uk\n\nAttention: This communication may contain privileged and confidential information intended solely for the recipient named above. If you have received this message in error, please be advised that any dissemination, distribution, or reproduction of its contents is strictly prohibited. Kindly notify ABL Circuits Ltd. immediately at 01462-894312.\n\nFrom: Purchasing - Sesame Access <purchasing@sesameaccess.com>\nSent: Tuesday, September 22, 2026 16:07\nTo: ABL Circuits Sales <sales@ablcircuits.co.uk>\nSubject: Lift PCB Enquiry - Design and manufacture - SQR-45454\n\nHello,\n\nI am contacting you on behalf of Sesame Access Systems, a UK manufacturer of platform lifts for wheelchair access.\n\nWe are investigating whether part of our existing DIN-rail lift control assembly could be replaced with a custom PCB. The aim is to reduce wiring, assembly time, build cost and servicing time while retaining the existing Siemens LOGO! 8 PLC and keeping the established safety functions outside the PCB.\n\nOur anticipated requirement is:\n\nFive initial prototypes\n\nA first production batch of approximately 25 units\n\nOngoing demand of approximately 50 units per year\n\nPCB design, manufacture, assembly and functional testing\n\nI have attached our feasibility study and a representative wiring diagram. These outline the existing control system, proposed PCB scope, technical requirements, expected volumes and key design considerations.\n\nAt this stage, we are looking for an experienced partner to provide an initial feasibility opinion, recommend a suitable architecture and provide indicative NRE and unit-cost estimates.\n\nIf this project is within your capabilities, we would welcome an introductory Teams meeting with your design and manufacturing team.\n\nMany Thanks,\n\nGiles\n\nPurchasing Manager\n\nSesame Access Systems Ltd\n\nUnit 1, Cumberland Works\n\nWintersells Business Park\n\nWest Byfleet\n\nSurrey\n\nUnited Kingdom\n\nKT14 7LF\n\nOffice: 01784 440088\n\nDIRECT LINE : 01784 904484\n\nEmail: purchasing@sesameaccess.com\n\nWeb: www.sesameaccess.com\n\nYouTube: www.youtube.com/sesameaccess",
  "full_text": "<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none\">\r\n<!--\r\np\r\n\t{margin-top:0;\r\n\tmargin-bottom:0}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Hi Giles,&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Thank you very much for your email.&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Unfortunately, we're not quite the right company for you. I highly recommend speaking with Christa Boren, christa@ripcorddesigns.com, at Ripcord Design.&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Ripcord is an electronics design house&nbsp;and the perfect company to redesign this for you. We're an electronics contract manufacturer and specialise in manufacturing and assembling PCBAs, rather than design. We've worked closely with Ripcord for years, and they're brilliant.&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Once the design is complete, we can step in to manufacture and assemble the PCBAs for you.&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Thank you and good luck with the redesign!&nbsp;</div><div id=\"Signature\" class=\"elementToProof\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Kind regards,&nbsp;<br></span></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"line-height:1.5; max-width:600px; color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"line-height:1.5; padding-right:16px; vertical-align:middle; width:170px\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"line-height:1.5; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:10pt; color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><img alt=\"ABL Circuits Ltd\" id=\"x_image_0\" width=\"170\" size=\"159582\" data-outlook-trace=\"F:1|T:1\" src=\"cid:1c33ff6c-dbd5-4c35-9d7d-9da994634c7