 Siemens LOGO! 8 PLC and keeping the established safety functions outside the PCB.</div><div style=\"direction:ltr; line-height:20px; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Our anticipated requirement is:</div><ul style=\"direction:ltr\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); direction:ltr; line-height:20px\">Five initial prototypes</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); direction:ltr; line-height:20px\">A first production batch of approximately 25 units</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); direction:ltr; line-height:20px\">Ongoing demand of approximately 50 units per year</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0); direction:ltr; line-height:20px\">PCB design, manufacture, assembly and functional testing</li></ul><div style=\"direction:ltr; line-height:20px; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I have attached our feasibility study and a representative wiring diagram. These outline the existing control system, proposed PCB scope, technical requirements, expected volumes and key design considerations.</div><div style=\"direction:ltr; line-height:20px; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">At this stage, we are looking for an experienced partner to provide an initial feasibility opinion, recommend a suitable architecture and provide indicative NRE and unit-cost estimates.</div><div style=\"direction:ltr; line-height:20px; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">If this project is within your capabilities, we would welcome an introductory Teams meeting with your design and manufacturing team.</div><div style=\"direction:ltr; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div id=\"x_x_x_x_Signature\"><div id=\"x_x_x_x_divtagdefaultwrapper\"><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Many Thanks,</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Giles</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Purchasing Manager</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Sesame Access Systems Ltd</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Unit 1, Cumberland Works</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Wintersells Business Park</span></p><p style=\"direction:ltr; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-family:Calibri,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span 